"""
MIDRA Engineering
Zoning Intelligence Engine

Purpose
-------
Provides municipal zoning and project-specific development intelligence.

Design principles
-----------------
1. Prefer authoritative municipal sources.
2. Prefer eCode360 when available.
3. Fall back to the municipality's official website when eCode360
   cannot be retrieved.
4. Never invent zoning requirements.
5. Clearly identify information that requires verification.
6. Preserve source URL, source type and retrieval timestamp.
7. Keep project-specific requirements separate from general bulk
   requirements.
8. Make the source registry extensible for additional New Jersey
   municipalities.

Current supported demonstration municipality
---------------------------------------------
Marlboro Township, Monmouth County, New Jersey.

The Marlboro code identifies:
- Â§220-34D: Schedule of Area, Yard and Building Requirements
- Â§220-56: R-20 Residential District
- Â§220-42: Private swimming, wading and portable pools
- Â§220-186: Private residential swimming pools

The engine intentionally does NOT hard-code numerical bulk
requirements unless they are actually extracted from an
authoritative source.
"""

